<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκος</span></b> , ὁ, a kind of
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hawk</i> or
			<i>falcon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴρηξ κίρκος</span>
			(where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴρηξ</span> is the generic term,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκος</span> the specific), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.87
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				857
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκου λεπάργου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					304.5
				</span></i>
			. (The species cannot be identified.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of <i>wolf</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.304
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>circle</i>, mostly in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίκος</span> (q.v.): hence, <i>ring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				161
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				49
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>): poet. for Prose <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίκος</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.94
			</span></i>:—neut. pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίρκα</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ καταδέσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
					121.299
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> later,
				= Lat.<i>circus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.22.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.16.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> unknown
			stone, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.153
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωπηλάτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VII.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ αἰγείρου
				βλάστησις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
